  "question": {
    "text": "If the truth value of the statement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>, then the truth value of which of the following is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math>?",
