  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is false, when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is true and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is false</p><p>So, for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;to be false,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;should be true and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is false.</p><p>i.e&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is true,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is false and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math>&nbsp;is false.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 100px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>F</td>\t\t\t<td>T</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Now,&nbsp;</p><p>for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>F</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
